state right
title "async 작업 하나의 생애주기"
subtitle "정상 완료, I/O 대기 후 재개, 취소, 실패가 같은 상태 위에서 갈라진다"

state created "생성됨"
state queued "대기열"
state running "실행 중"
state awaiting "await 대기" 
state done "완료"
state cancelled "취소됨"
state failed "실패"
start created
final done
final cancelled
final failed

created -> queued "`spawn`"
queued -> running "루프가 `poll`"
running -> awaiting "I/O 요청"
awaiting -> running "`wake` 후 다시 `poll`"
running -> done "`return`"
awaiting -> cancelled "`cancel()`" dashed
running -> failed "예외 발생" dashed

step "정상 완료" "I/O 없이 끝까지 실행한다"
  created -> queued
  queued -> running
  running -> done
step "I/O 대기 후 재개" "await에서 양보했다가 I/O가 끝나면 이어서 실행한다"
  created -> queued
  queued -> running
  running -> awaiting "소켓 읽기"
  wait 1s
  awaiting -> running
  running -> done
step "취소" "대기 중인 작업은 취소 요청을 받으면 바로 끝난다"
  queued -> running
  running -> awaiting
  awaiting -> cancelled "타임아웃"
step "실패" "실행 중 예외가 나면 실패로 끝나고 await한 쪽에 전달된다"
  queued -> running
  running -> failed "`ValueError`"
